    "body": "Awesome, thanks so much!\r\n\r\nBy the way, you may want to read up on Git branching; I think it will make it easier for you to submit pull requests in the future, instead of doing the revert-then-new-commit thing you are currently doing. If each pull request comes from a branch, things can be cleaner. It looks like the first section of https://gist.github.com/Chaser324/ce0505fbed06b947d962 is helpful in this regard.\r\n\r\nWhat you're doing now is OK for us, since it is easy for us to squash everything into a single commit, but seems a bit messy for you. So just wanted to let you know :)",
